    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[The wfx GitHub stealer: an October rehearsal, and what a deleted run proves]]></title>
        <id>https://mate.security/labs/the-wfx-github-stealer-an-october-rehearsal-and-what-a-deleted-run-proves</id>
        <link href="https://mate.security/labs/the-wfx-github-stealer-an-october-rehearsal-and-what-a-deleted-run-proves"/>
        <updated>2026-11-17T02:01:27.039Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/labs/the-wfx-github-stealer-an-october-rehearsal-and-what-a-deleted-run-proves" class="news_collection-item-inner"><div class="news_heading"><div class="news_image-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6af6e6a6498f75032f20de77_cover.jpg" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6af6e6a6498f75032f20de77_cover-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6af6e6a6498f75032f20de77_cover-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6af6e6a6498f75032f20de77_cover-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6af6e6a6498f75032f20de77_cover.jpg 1144w" class="news_image"></div><h3 class="h4-style text-style-2lines">The wfx GitHub stealer: an October rehearsal, and what a deleted run proves</h3><p class="text-style-3lines">Mate Research is tracking wfx, a credential stealer pushed into GitHub repositories with stolen tokens and reverted within a minute wherever the revert was timed. Where it runs, it takes the build’s secrets and tries to keep access to AWS and Entra. Mate’s hunting agent found an October rehearsal, and that a missing workflow run does not show the stealer ran.</p></div></a><div class="authors_details"><div class="authors_collection w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="authors_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="authors_collection-item w-dyn-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a993b505781890469686a31_Nadav%20headshot.jpeg" alt="" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Nadav Lorber</div></div></div></div><div>13 Nov 2026</div></div>]]></content>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fake Claude Code ads are installing AMOS on Macs]]></title>
        <id>https://mate.security/labs/fake-claude-code-ads-are-installing-amos-on-macs</id>
        <link href="https://mate.security/labs/fake-claude-code-ads-are-installing-amos-on-macs"/>
        <updated>2026-11-17T02:01:27.040Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/labs/fake-claude-code-ads-are-installing-amos-on-macs" class="news_collection-item-inner"><div class="news_heading"><div class="news_image-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6aec58b831c389cd86d9495b_cover.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6aec58b831c389cd86d9495b_cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6aec58b831c389cd86d9495b_cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6aec58b831c389cd86d9495b_cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6aec58b831c389cd86d9495b_cover.png 1144w" class="news_image"></div><h3 class="h4-style text-style-2lines">Fake Claude Code ads are installing AMOS on Macs</h3><p class="text-style-3lines">Mate Research is tracking an active campaign that uses fake Claude Code ads to install the AMOS stealer and a root backdoor on developers' Macs. One install can give away an organization's cloud access. Beyond the known copy-and-paste route, Mate's hunting agent found Apple-signed installers that need no paste. The attackers change servers with every build, so blocklists usually miss it. This report includes detections you can deploy today that catch the malware by its behavior on either route, and some also find Macs that are already infected.</p></div></a><div class="authors_details"><div class="authors_collection w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="authors_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="authors_collection-item w-dyn-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a993b505781890469686a31_Nadav%20headshot.jpeg" alt="" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Nadav Lorber</div></div></div></div><div>05 Nov 2026</div></div>]]></content>
    </entry>
