        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Blue City by Mate Security]]></title>
        <id>https://mate.security/labs/blue-city-by-mate-security</id>
        <link href="https://mate.security/labs/blue-city-by-mate-security"/>
        <updated>2026-11-17T02:01:27.042Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/labs/blue-city-by-mate-security" class="news_collection-item-inner"><div class="news_heading"><div class="news_image-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6accd9ed3411af81b1e78c75_cover%20blog%20inbal-%20Blue%20City%20by%20Mate%20Security%20(1).jpg" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6accd9ed3411af81b1e78c75_cover%20blog%20inbal-%20Blue%20City%20by%20Mate%20Security%20(1)-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6accd9ed3411af81b1e78c75_cover%20blog%20inbal-%20Blue%20City%20by%20Mate%20Security%20(1)-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6accd9ed3411af81b1e78c75_cover%20blog%20inbal-%20Blue%20City%20by%20Mate%20Security%20(1)-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6accd9ed3411af81b1e78c75_cover%20blog%20inbal-%20Blue%20City%20by%20Mate%20Security%20(1)-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6accd9ed3411af81b1e78c75_cover%20blog%20inbal-%20Blue%20City%20by%20Mate%20Security%20(1).jpg 1920w" class="news_image"></div><h3 class="h4-style text-style-2lines">Blue City by Mate Security</h3><p class="text-style-3lines">Blue City is Mate Security’s simulated enterprise for testing AI security agents, where business keeps running during an attack and every defensive action has real consequences. It measures what actually matters in defense: how much damage an agent prevents, what it costs, and whether it can tell a real threat from legitimate work.</p></div></a><div class="authors_details"><div class="authors_collection w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="authors_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="authors_collection-item w-dyn-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6acd1ea5a1f6c941ae158788_Guy-Pergal1-1.webp" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6acd1ea5a1f6c941ae158788_Guy-Pergal1-1-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6acd1ea5a1f6c941ae158788_Guy-Pergal1-1-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6acd1ea5a1f6c941ae158788_Guy-Pergal1-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6acd1ea5a1f6c941ae158788_Guy-Pergal1-1.webp 1144w" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Guy Pergal</div></div><div role="listitem" class="authors_collection-item w-dyn-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a8d93b42da14174ce3a13c6_Inbal%20Headshot.avif" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a8d93b42da14174ce3a13c6_Inbal%20Headshot-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a8d93b42da14174ce3a13c6_Inbal%20Headshot.avif 514w" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Inbal Argov</div></div></div></div><div>03 Nov 2026</div></div>]]></content>
