00d9e40b6765a/6ab00f05f661aa2fdfcafa6e_Ofer%20Headshot.jpeg 800w" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Ofer Itzhaki</div></div></div></div><div>28 Sep 2026</div></div>]]></content>
