        <title type="html"><![CDATA[The Alert That Didn't Fire: How Mate Reasoned Past a Silent Credential Theft]]></title>
        <id>https://mate.security/labs/the-alert-that-didnt-fire-how-mate-reasoned-past-a-silent-credential-theft</id>
        <link href="https://mate.security/labs/the-alert-that-didnt-fire-how-mate-reasoned-past-a-silent-credential-theft"/>
        <updated>2026-09-03T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/labs/the-alert-that-didnt-fire-how-mate-reasoned-past-a-silent-credential-theft" class="news_collection-item-inner"><div class="news_heading"><div class="news_image-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a997b12066ad132f4bfbd37_The%20Alert%20That%20Didn%27t%20Fire%20-%20%20BLOG-1.jpg" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a997b12066ad132f4bfbd37_The%20Alert%20That%20Didn%27t%20Fire%20-%20%20BLOG-1-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a997b12066ad132f4bfbd37_The%20Alert%20That%20Didn%27t%20Fire%20-%20%20BLOG-1-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a997b12066ad132f4bfbd37_The%20Alert%20That%20Didn%27t%20Fire%20-%20%20BLOG-1-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a997b12066ad132f4bfbd37_The%20Alert%20That%20Didn%27t%20Fire%20-%20%20BLOG-1-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a997b12066ad132f4bfbd37_The%20Alert%20That%20Didn%27t%20Fire%20-%20%20BLOG-1.jpg 1920w" class="news_image"></div><h3 class="h4-style text-style-2lines">The Alert That Didn't Fire: How Mate Reasoned Past a Silent Credential Theft</h3><p class="text-style-3lines">What happens when an AI system does not have all data for an investigation? One option is to hallucinate a verdict or claim "inconclusive". Another is to ask sharper questions, and pull in whatever context is available. This is a case study from a real-world incident.</p></div></a><div class="authors_details"><div class="authors_collection w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="authors_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="authors_collection-item w-dyn-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/6a993b505781890469686a31_Nadav%20headshot.jpeg" alt="" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Nadav Lorber</div></div></div></div><div>03 Sep 2026</div></div>]]></content>
    </entry>
