        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Code, Disrupted: The AI Transformation of Software Development]]></title>
        <id>https://mate.security/labs/ai-transformation-of-software-development</id>
        <link href="https://mate.security/labs/ai-transformation-of-software-development"/>
        <updated>2025-12-01T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/labs/ai-transformation-of-software-development" class="news_collection-item-inner"><div class="news_heading"><div class="news_image-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/69bc05d46de76bf744099bb6_692d68985fdc76ad9769f45d_ai-transformation-of-software-development.avif" class="news_image"></div><h3 class="h4-style text-style-2lines">Code, Disrupted: The AI Transformation of Software Development</h3><p class="text-style-3lines">Software development is entering an AI-driven era, with automated workflows, faster cycles, and human-AI collaboration redefining how engineering teams build and ship products.</p></div></a><div class="authors_details"><div class="authors_collection w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="authors_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="authors_collection-item w-dyn-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/69bbe8fa55820c89d9131c6c_691ddcf19d14ac2e7be6cb1a_asaf-wiener.avif" alt="" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Asaf Wiener</div></div></div></div><div>01 Dec 2025</div></div>]]></content>
