        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Rise of the Super Analyst: How AI is Empowering (Not Replacing) SOC Teams]]></title>
        <id>https://mate.security/labs/ai-empowering-soc-teams</id>
        <link href="https://mate.security/labs/ai-empowering-soc-teams"/>
        <updated>2025-12-01T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/labs/ai-empowering-soc-teams" class="news_collection-item-inner"><div class="news_heading"><div class="news_image-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/69bc05d62606f968606b9d09_692d6902f2061d760731f904_rise-of-the-super-analyst.avif" class="news_image"></div><h3 class="h4-style text-style-2lines">Rise of the Super Analyst: How AI is Empowering (Not Replacing) SOC Teams</h3><p class="text-style-3lines">AI isn’t replacing SOC analysts, it’s transforming them into “super analysts.” By automating repetitive tasks, AI enables teams to focus on high-impact investigations, strategy, and smarter threat response.</p></div></a><div class="authors_details"><div class="authors_collection w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="authors_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="authors_collection-item w-dyn-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/69bbe8fac39767f41a9504f3_6926c2eb2ce608abed20f5a0_dana-rozen.avif" alt="" class="news_logo"><div class="text-weight-bold">Dana Rozen</div></div></div></div><div>01 Dec 2025</div></div>]]></content>
    </entry>
